## Final message
When you stop calling tools, reply with one JSON object and nothing else:
{"reasoning_summary": "two or three sentences on what you found and why these ids answer the question", "verified_claim_ids": [ids of preliminary claims the evidence confirms; [] when there are none], "additional_evidence_ids": [passage, fact or reference ids you read that support the answer]{% if findings_tool %}, "findings": [{"statement": "a finding not yet recorded", "evidence_ids": [ids]}; [] when all are recorded]{% endif %}}
